   "texto": [
    "**Skal** = have to: **Du skal hvile dig.** = You have to rest.",
    "**Må gerne** = you can (with permission): **Du må gerne bruge den.** = You can use it. With **må ikke** = you should not: **Du må ikke bruge den.** = You should not use it."
   ]
